          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Tips to Go Green</h1>\n    <p>It is important that we take care of our planet. Here are some tips for how you can be more green.</p>\n    <p>1. Bring a reusable bag to the store. Avoid getting plastic or paper bags.</p>\n    <p>2. Turn off electronics and lights when you are not using them to reduce electricty use.</p>\n    <p>3. Only buy what you need, and borrow items you  only need once or twice. This will reduce waste. </p>\n  </body>\n</html>",
